  "hints": [
    "If you knew the length L, the node to remove is at position L - n from the front.",
    "Two pointers n nodes apart let you find it in one pass. A dummy node in front of the head avoids a special case.",
    "Put dummy -> head; move fast n steps ahead, then move fast and slow together until fast.next is None; set slow.next = slow.next.next and return dummy.next."
